{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01BWT8BBPgjhh2UcjS5PWH3s","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Handover — 2026-05-22\n2\t\n3\t> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\n4\t\n5\t## 运行中\n6\t| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\n7\t|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\n8\t| plan001_step1_full_v4 | Expanding from 6 to 15 models (9 API + 6 local) across 6 families and 3 capability tiers breaks the structural K_eff-η_max collinearity (r=-0.8 with 6 models). With 15 models, panels can have high K_eff (cross-family diversity) without necessarily including weak judges, enabling clean separation of diversity vs robustness effects. | — | — | — |\n9\t\n10\t## 待处理\n11\t- plan001_step1_full_v3（准备中）\n12\t- plan001_step1_full_v2（准备中）\n13\t- plan001_step1_full（准备中）\n14\t- plan001_step1_dryrun3（准备中）\n15\t- plan001_step1_dryrun2（准备中）\n16\t- plan001_step1_dryrun（准备中）\n17\t\n18\t## 近期结论\n19\t- **taxonomy-broad-spectrum** (negative): K_eff is a significant negative predictor of panel ASR specifically for broad-spectrum attacks (verbosity bias, position bias, authority bias) that exploit shared judge biases, consistent across both MMLU and ARC datasets. This validates the attack taxonomy: targeted attacks → η_max dominates; broad-spectrum attacks → K_eff provides additional protection. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry3\n20\t- **mvp-step2v3-retry3** (negative): Controlling for individual model robustness (η_max), higher K_eff panels have significantly lower ASR. Multi-factor regression log(ASR) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max) should show K_eff coefficient significantly negative. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry2\n21\t- **mvp-step2v3-retry2** (failed): Controlling for individual model robustness (η_max), higher K_eff panels have significantly lower ASR. The SDPI bound η_joint ≤ K_eff · η_max has two factors: K_eff (diversity) and η_max (weakest-link robustness). Step 2 v2 confounded them. Multi-factor regression log(ASR) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max) should show K_eff coefficient significantly negative. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry\n22\t\n23\t## 趋势\n24\t成功 0 / 负向 3 / 失败 3 / 共 6\n25\t\n26\t## 下一步\n27\t（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\n28\t\n29\t## 资源状态\n30\tseetacloud-rtx6000: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\n31\t\n32\t## 告警\n33\t- mvp-step2v3-regression: 训练失败 — unknown\n34\t- mvp-step2v3-retry: 训练失败 — unknown\n35\t- mvp-step2v3-retry2: 训练失败 — unknown\n36\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"3ed5c3be-57f1-436e-8892-6664bcba0bfd","uuid":"c855de43-0d0d-41d7-b32f-65e22b4a8349","timestamp":"2026-05-22T17:41:15.042Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0519_2/projects/cert_manip_resist_eval/report.md","content":"# Handover — 2026-05-22\n\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\n\n## 运行中\n| exp_id | 假设 | 状态 | 关键指标 | W&B |\n|--------|------|------|---------|-----|\n| plan001_step1_full_v4 | Expanding from 6 to 15 models (9 API + 6 local) across 6 families and 3 capability tiers breaks the structural K_eff-η_max collinearity (r=-0.8 with 6 models). With 15 models, panels can have high K_eff (cross-family diversity) without necessarily including weak judges, enabling clean separation of diversity vs robustness effects. | — | — | — |\n\n## 待处理\n- plan001_step1_full_v3（准备中）\n- plan001_step1_full_v2（准备中）\n- plan001_step1_full（准备中）\n- plan001_step1_dryrun3（准备中）\n- plan001_step1_dryrun2（准备中）\n- plan001_step1_dryrun（准备中）\n\n## 近期结论\n- **taxonomy-broad-spectrum** (negative): K_eff is a significant negative predictor of panel ASR specifically for broad-spectrum attacks (verbosity bias, position bias, authority bias) that exploit shared judge biases, consistent across both MMLU and ARC datasets. This validates the attack taxonomy: targeted attacks → η_max dominates; broad-spectrum attacks → K_eff provides additional protection. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry3\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry3** (negative): Controlling for individual model robustness (η_max), higher K_eff panels have significantly lower ASR. Multi-factor regression log(ASR) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max) should show K_eff coefficient significantly negative. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry2\n- **mvp-step2v3-retry2** (failed): Controlling for individual model robustness (η_max), higher K_eff panels have significantly lower ASR. The SDPI bound η_joint ≤ K_eff · η_max has two factors: K_eff (diversity) and η_max (weakest-link robustness). Step 2 v2 confounded them. Multi-factor regression log(ASR) ~ log(K_eff) + log(η_max) should show K_eff coefficient significantly negative. ← 基于 mvp-step2v3-retry\n\n## 趋势\n成功 0 / 负向 3 / 失败 3 / 共 6\n\n## 下一步\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\n\n## 资源状态\nseetacloud-rtx6000: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\n\n## 告警\n- mvp-step2v3-regression: 训练失败 — unknown\n- mvp-step2v3-retry: 训练失败 — unknown\n- mvp-step2v3-retry2: 训练失败 — unknown\n","numLines":36,"startLine":1,"totalLines":36}}}
